<p>Haye.<br> Haaye sham e ghareeba'n<br> haye zainab..<br> Haye zainab ne dekha wo manzar ke hua dil betaab<br> ek sawaar aaya idhar daalke chehre pa naqaab<br> badh ke zainab ne basad jao hasham tok diya<br> baazu pe tham ke haath usko wahi rok diya<br> boli ab lootne wale yaha'n kya payenge<br> dekhiye bachhe mere khauf se mar jayenge<br> yak ba yak noor ke khaane mein jo chehra dekha<br> ghum o andoh bhara sakht ka yaara na raha<br> cheekh ek maar ke wo baap ke qadmo pe giri<br> hosh jab aaya to ro ro ke baya'n karne lagi<br> sattar qadam ka fasla, bhai behen mein tha..(2)</p> 
<p>zainab lipat ke baap se deti rahi sada<br> sattar qadam ka fasla, bhai behen mein tha..(2)</p> 
<p>1. Zalim mere hussain ke seene pe tha sawaar<br> gin gin ke kar raha tha wo pyaase gale pe waar<br> hasta tha baar baar laee'n mere bayn par..(2)<br> khanjar chala raha tha meri simt dekh kar<br> aankho'n ke saamne mere bhai ka sar kata</p> 
<p>2. Har waar par sadayein di zehra ke chayn ne<br> ghazi ko tera baar pukara hussain ne<br> jaane batool ko bhi bachane na aaoge..(2)<br> bhai hamari laash uthane na aaoge<br> bhai ki har sadaa pe tadapta tha bawafa</p> 
<p>3. Kya kya na dekha aapki zainab ne baba jaa'n<br> khanjar rawa'n tha halq pe khoo'n halq se rawa'n<br> takti thi apna rukh mai chupaye rida ke saath..(2)<br> khanjar wo saaf karta tha sheh ki abaa ke saath<br> bhai tha mera khaak par be jaa'n pada hua</p> 
<p>4. Bosa gahe rasool ko jab zibha kar chuka<br> zulfo se sar utha liya mere hussain ka<br> is baat par bhi zalimo ke dil nahi bhare..(2)<br> saydaniyo'n ki maut ke asbaab yu kiye<br> sar ko dar e khayam pe laakar gira diya</p> 
<p>5. Seene mein uske, pehlu mein, aankho'n mein teer the<br> peshani par bhi teer the uske lage hue<br> baba najaf ki simt pukara hai aapko..(2)<br> us waqt yaad karte the hum dono baap ko<br> mai kya kahu ke kaise wo sajda adaa hua</p> 
<p>6. Jee bhar ke teer jis ghadi barsa chuke laee'n<br> baalo se jism shaah ka zakhma chuke laee'n<br> talwaar aazmate the us tanha jaan par..(2)<br> zakhmo pe garm ret girate the aan kar<br> patthar wo marta raha patthar jise mila</p> 
<p>7. Hote the zakhmi jis ghadi amma ki ungliya'n<br> rokar ye bayn karte the shabbir natawa'n<br> aye shimr mera sar jo tu chahe kaat le..(2)<br> amma ka haath mujhko gale se hatane de<br> lekin laeen shimr ka khanjar nahi ruka</p> 
<p>8. Jaate hue bhi dil mein sakina ka tha khayaal<br> wada ye humse leke gaya tha tumhara laal<br> rakhiyo sambhal kar ye amanat hussain ki..(2)<br> marte samay kuch aisi thi halat hussain ki<br> bus baar baar haaye sakina pukarta</p> 
<p>9. Akbar ajeeb sham e ghareeba'n ki thi ghadi<br> rokar ali se kehti thi zehra ki laadli<br> baba mai chaah kar bhi na us waqt mar saki..(2)<br> jis dum badan se rooh ki parwaaz dekhi thi<br> mai dekhti rahi mera bhai chala gaya</p> 
<p>sattar qadam ka fasla, bhai behen mein tha<br> mai bhai bhai kehti thi laasha bahan bahan..(2)</p>